  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 740726,
    "RowId": 40000,
    "Text": "Find Beruru!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 740750,
    "RowId": 40001,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 740762,
    "RowId": 40002,
    "Text": "Defeat Janquetilaque's portrait!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 740806,
    "RowId": 40003,
    "Text": "So many paintings, kupo... I have a bad feeling about this."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 740878,
    "RowId": 40004,
    "Text": "Is this their idea of a welcome!? Have at them, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 740954,
    "RowId": 40005,
    "Text": "Those monsters...they were muses, given life by pictomancy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741026,
    "RowId": 40006,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741038,
    "RowId": 40007,
    "Text": "Beruru, Janquetilaque and I once encountered a griffin like that in Gyr Abania! Be careful, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741158,
    "RowId": 40008,
    "Text": "Your corpse shall serve as the highlight of my gallery!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741226,
    "RowId": 40009,
    "Text": "Bloom forth, my muse, and let mind become matter!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741286,
    "RowId": 40010,
    "Text": "Can you perceive the truth behind my hues!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741342,
    "RowId": 40011,
    "Text": "The shade of my arbors will grant you no solace!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741402,
    "RowId": 40012,
    "Text": "Reality is mine to shape! Mountains mine to command!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741466,
    "RowId": 40013,
    "Text": "No... I cannot fall to a forgery..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741514,
    "RowId": 40014,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741526,
    "RowId": 40015,
