    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741886,
    "RowId": 40045,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741898,
    "RowId": 40046,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741910,
    "RowId": 40047,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741922,
    "RowId": 40048,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741934,
    "RowId": 40049,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 741946,
    "RowId": 40050,
    "Text": "Here we are, kupo! I sense monsters lurking below..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742010,
    "RowId": 40051,
    "Text": "But before we charge in, allow me to expound upon the fundamentals of pictomancy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742102,
    "RowId": 40052,
    "Text": "You must first paint a motif on canvas. Only then can you bring it to life!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742190,
    "RowId": 40053,
    "Text": "Try making a Pom Motif. Go on, don't be shy!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742246,
    "RowId": 40054,
    "Text": "Well done, kupo! Now to unleash it upon your foes."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742310,
    "RowId": 40055,
    "Text": "Focus your magicks on that striking dummy and summon your Pom Muse!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742390,
    "RowId": 40056,
    "Text": "ちょうど、そこに「古びた木人」があるから、\nまずは「イマジンポンポン」を試してみるクポ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742534,
    "RowId": 40057,
    "Text": "Cast Pom Muse"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742558,
    "RowId": 40058,
    "Text": "Poms awaaay! Splendid work, kupo."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742602,
    "RowId": 40059,
    "Text": "Next, give me your best Wing Motif."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742650,
    "RowId": 40060,
    "Text": "Cast Wing Motif"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742678,
    "RowId": 40061,
    "Text": "Very good, kupo! Now you may invoke your Winged Muse against our friend the striking dummy."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742782,
    "RowId": 40062,
    "Text": "Cast Winged Muse"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742810,
    "RowId": 40063,
    "Text": "With poms and wings fresh in your mind, I want you to imagine what these muses could accomplish together..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 742930,
    "RowId": 40064,
    "Text": "By fusing them, you'll give life to a fantastical moogle, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743006,
    "RowId": 40065,
    "Text": "Think big, mognificent thoughts and envision your new friend: Mog of the Ages!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743098,
    "RowId": 40066,
    "Text": "Cast Mog of the Ages"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743130,
    "RowId": 40067,
    "Text": "Excellent, kupo! He may not be as winsome as yours truly, but he should serve you well enough."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743238,
    "RowId": 40068,
    "Text": "Aside from your moogle, a Hammer Stamp is an excellent alternative to pummeling foes!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743334,
    "RowId": 40069,
    "Text": "But if you wish to provide support, I recommend inspiring your allies with a Starry Muse."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743434,
    "RowId": 40070,
    "Text": "Never stop dreaming up those motifs, kupo! Your allies will thank you, and your enemies won't know what hit them."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743558,
    "RowId": 40071,
    "Text": "予想以上に魔物がいっぱい……\nひとまず、こいつらを蹴散らすクポ～！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743670,
    "RowId": 40072,
    "Text": "そうそう、ピクトマンサーは筆に宿らせた魔力を放つ、\n「色魔法」でも攻撃できるクポ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743806,
    "RowId": 40073,
    "Text": "ちなみに、色魔法は使い続けることで、\nパレットに魔力を蓄積することができるクポよ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 743942,
    "RowId": 40074,
    "Text": "溜めた魔力で「サブトラクティブパレット」を使えば、\n強力な色魔法が放てるから、試してほしいクポ～！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744102,
    "RowId": 40075,
    "Text": "Use Subtractive Palette and cast Blizzard in Cyan or Blizzard II in Cyan"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744186,
    "RowId": 40076,
    "Text": "Use Subtractive Palette and cast Stone in Yellow or Stone II in Yellow"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744270,
    "RowId": 40077,
    "Text": "Use Subtractive Palette and cast Thunder in Magenta or Thunder II in Magenta"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744358,
    "RowId": 40078,
    "Text": "You're a natural with that Subtractive Palette, kupo!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744422,
    "RowId": 40079,
    "Text": "It seems you've scared off the stragglers, as well! Let's head further in."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744510,
    "RowId": 40080,
    "Text": "Ah, now that's an obnoxious noisemaker, kupo."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744566,
    "RowId": 40081,
    "Text": "Since you've grasped the basics, I'll leave you to your pictomancy─show that spriggan what for!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744674,
    "RowId": 40082,
    "Text": "Painting a motif takes concentration, kupo! Time your brushstrokes wisely."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744762,
    "RowId": 40083,
    "Text": "If your enemy's movements begin to overwhelm, bring one of your muses to life!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744854,
    "RowId": 40084,
    "Text": "Search for the source of the noise!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744902,
    "RowId": 40085,
    "Text": "Defeat the spriggan clatterer!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744946,
    "RowId": 40086,
    "Text": "Speak with Kupopo"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 744974,
    "RowId": 40087,
    "Text": "Your Striking Muse looks like quite the clobberer, kupo! Very impressive."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745058,
    "RowId": 40088,
    "Text": "What breathtaking scenery, kupo! Had we other allies here, I'm certain they'd be just as awed."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745166,
    "RowId": 40089,
    "Text": "Faster than a speeding paintbrush, kupo! When you require a swift escape, safety is a Smudge away!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745278,
    "RowId": 40090,
    "Text": "All set, kupo? Then it's time we silenced that noise!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745342,
    "RowId": 40091,
    "Text": "Speak with Kupopo again"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745378,
    "RowId": 40092,
    "Text": "It takes some getting used to, so feel free to experiment, kupo! I'll be here when you're ready."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745486,
    "RowId": 40093,
    "Text": "Cast Pom Motif"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745514,
    "RowId": 40094,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745526,
    "RowId": 40095,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745538,
    "RowId": 40096,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745550,
    "RowId": 40097,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745562,
    "RowId": 40098,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745574,
    "RowId": 40099,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745586,
    "RowId": 40100,
    "Text": "Defeat Virazahn!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745614,
    "RowId": 40101,
    "Text": "Quell the Perch of the Apex!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745654,
    "RowId": 40102,
    "Text": "Today we learn who the true hero is."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745702,
    "RowId": 40103,
    "Text": "I've had enough of his dribble! It's time to knock that smirk off his face!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745790,
    "RowId": 40104,
    "Text": "Hehe... The Perch of the Apex awakens!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745842,
    "RowId": 40105,
    "Text": "Run! Run or be crushed under a hail of stones!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 745902,
    "RowId": 40106,
    "Text": "Hah hah hah! Not even you are nimble enough to escape this! Give up, for I am invincible!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746002,
    "RowId": 40107,
    "Text": "Impressive footwork...but all legs must tire in time!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746066,
    "RowId": 40108,
    "Text": "Heh, you are as fierce as they say. Yet I wield potions concocted by Thavnair's finest alchemists!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746178,
    "RowId": 40109,
    "Text": "You have done well, but your fight ends here. My alchemical minions shall be your downfall!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746282,
    "RowId": 40110,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746294,
    "RowId": 40111,
    "Text": "Even I was hard-pressed to defeat them... And today they show that no hero is immortal!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746394,
    "RowId": 40112,
    "Text": "Flee now and you may live to fight again!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746446,
    "RowId": 40113,
    "Text": "You...you defeated them already!? Uh... But of course, who would wish this duel to end so quickly!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746558,
    "RowId": 40114,
    "Text": "What!? My armor! MY ARMOR!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746598,
    "RowId": 40115,
    "Text": "The artifact... I've never seen it shine so..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746658,
    "RowId": 40116,
    "Text": "Hahaha! Such power as I've never witnessed before! The apex roars with fury untold!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746754,
    "RowId": 40117,
    "Text": "Its...power yet grows!? In the face of greater danger, I become ever more unassailable!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746854,
    "RowId": 40118,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746866,
    "RowId": 40119,
    "Text": "Why won't you fall!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746898,
    "RowId": 40120,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 746910,
    "RowId": 40121,
    "Text": "This...this cannot be! I am meant to be king...I will not fall ere I ascend the throne!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747010,
    "RowId": 40122,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747022,
    "RowId": 40123,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747034,
    "RowId": 40124,
    "Text": "Get out here, you bloody things! Just...just stop them, now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747106,
    "RowId": 40125,
    "Text": "We...we both suffer grievous wounds. Perhaps we should...consider this a draw..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747198,
    "RowId": 40126,
    "Text": "I'm utterly defenseless... This rotten piece of wood was supposed to make me invincible!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747298,
    "RowId": 40127,
    "Text": "It's...it's out of control!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747338,
    "RowId": 40128,
    "Text": "What's...what's happening!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747378,
    "RowId": 40129,
    "Text": "I can't...I can't move... The artifact, it's..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747438,
    "RowId": 40130,
    "Text": "M-Money, you like money, yes? I'll give you as much as you want, just don't let me die!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747538,
    "RowId": 40131,
    "Text": "Ungh... It can't...it can't end like this. I won't let it... I won't let it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747626,
    "RowId": 40132,
    "Text": "Virazahn can't suppress the fear in his heart, and the apex has responded in kind. We have to stop it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747742,
    "RowId": 40133,
    "Text": "But I am...a hero... Someone...someone save me..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747802,
    "RowId": 40134,
    "Text": "Ungh... I cannot lose..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747838,
    "RowId": 40135,
    "Text": "It'll swallow us if we don't stop it soon!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747894,
    "RowId": 40136,
    "Text": "Don't you ever shut up!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747930,
    "RowId": 40137,
    "Text": "You've lost, Virazahn. Lay down your weapon!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 747986,
    "RowId": 40138,
    "Text": ""
  },
